# The scenes of the finding-flaky-tests deck, in order. Each "## Scene N: title" is one slide, spoken with item N of
# finding-flaky-tests.narration.md. Each line under a heading puts one thing on the slide:
#   note "<text>"         a line of text
#   show <file> ...       a code panel: <from> <to> or /pattern/, then a label; --mark and --zoom mark lines
#   run_live "<command>"  a live run, played from its cast in finding-flaky-tests.outputs/
#   callout "<text>"      a boxed sentence saying what a result means

## Scene 1: step 1, the version catalogue
note "Step 1: add Awaitility to the version catalogue."
show libs.versions.toml "/awaitility/" gradle/libs.versions.toml

## Scene 2: step 2, the dependency
note "Step 2: add it to the lesson. Only the tests wait, so it is a test dependency."
show lessons/finding-flaky-tests/example/build.gradle.kts "/^dependencies/" "lesson build file" --zoom 9

## Scene 3: the order desk
note "The order desk takes an order and returns at once. The confirmation follows on a *background thread*."
show OrderDesk 12 15 "the order desk" --zoom 14

## Scene 4: the code under test
note "The mail server in today's *busy* continuous integration: every third message waits 600 ms."
show TodaysBusyMailServer 20 26 "today's busy mail server" --zoom 22-23

## Scene 5: the sleeping test
note "The *sleeping* test: place an order, sleep 200 ms, then check. Run 5 times."
show SleepingTest 14 24 "the sleeping test" --zoom 15-20

## Scene 6: five runs find the flaky test
note "Run the tests on today's busy machine:"
run_live "./gradlew :lessons:finding-flaky-tests:test -Pcode=today"
callout "Nothing changed between runs: run 3 waited 600 ms for the mail queue, longer than the test slept."

## Scene 7: the waiting test
note "The *waiting* test: Awaitility checks every 50 ms, for at most 2 seconds."
show WaitingTest 15 25 "the waiting test" --zoom 21-24

## Scene 8: a quiet machine
note "The same tests on a quiet machine, like the laptop they were written on:"
run_live "./gradlew :lessons:finding-flaky-tests:test"
callout "Wait for the result, never sleep for a guess, and let no new test in without five clean runs."
